1
00:00:11,520 --> 00:00:12,920
Hello, Mr. Snail.

2
00:00:13,540 --> 00:00:15,760
Oh, you cute little Cornu aspersum.

3
00:00:16,680 --> 00:00:19,362
Latin name. Bonus points!

4
00:00:19,362 --> 00:00:24,510
I can't believe we got stuck with a tree hugger.

5
00:00:24,510 --> 00:00:27,400
If I have to hear the Latin name for one more animal,

6
00:00:27,400 --> 00:00:28,620
I swear I'm gonna kill her!

7
00:00:28,620 --> 00:00:30,353
Relax, sugar buns.

8
00:00:30,353 --> 00:00:33,340
While she does all the work,
we'll have all the fun.

9
00:00:33,340 --> 00:00:35,820
Y- yeah, and get wasted out of our minds.

10
00:00:36,520 --> 00:00:38,019
Way ahead of you, man!

11
00:00:38,019 --> 00:00:38,777
Come on, team!

12
00:00:38,777 --> 00:00:42,000
We mustn't dilly-dally when
there's so much nature to see.

13
00:00:42,640 --> 00:00:46,740
I was thinking, we should call our
class project, "Fungis in a Forest."

14
00:00:47,700 --> 00:00:51,561
Get it? Because we're a group of
fun guys and also fungis.

15
00:00:51,561 --> 00:00:52,040
Shush!

16
00:00:52,740 --> 00:00:55,440
That's a yellow wagtail. And she's in distress.

17
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:59,040
There, there, my little Morticella flava.

18
00:01:01,040 --> 00:01:02,780
Oh, look at her go.

19
00:01:04,500 --> 00:01:04,879
Wow.

20
00:01:05,540 --> 00:01:06,871
Out of the way, dorkwad.

21
00:01:06,871 --> 00:01:07,980
We're camping here!

22
00:01:08,620 --> 00:01:11,280
Finally! Time to get that barbecue burning.

23
00:01:11,400 --> 00:01:13,100
Oh. Oh. Oh, dear.
